SCOPE AND PRIVACY NOTICE  /  适用范围与隐私声明

What this tool does
  cachereach reads localStorage data that web browsers store on YOUR OWN
  computer, and exports it to files you choose. It is intended to recover
  your own data - for example game progress that lives only in the browser,
  or data you need before switching machines or a service shutting down.

  本工具仅从你自己的电脑上读取浏览器保存的 localStorage 数据，
  并导出到你指定的文件。用于恢复你自己的数据，例如仅存在于浏览器中的
  游戏存档，或在换机、服务停服前抢救数据。

Data it can read
  Web pages may store login tokens, session identifiers, preferences and
  other content in localStorage. Because this tool reads localStorage
  generically, exported files MAY CONTAIN SUCH DATA for the sites you have
  visited. Treat exported files as sensitive.

  网页可能在 localStorage 中保存登录令牌、会话标识、偏好设置等内容。
  本工具是通用读取，因此导出文件可能包含你访问过的站点的此类数据。
  请将导出文件视为敏感文件妥善保管。

Guarantees
  - Read-only. The tool never writes to, modifies or deletes any browser
    file. Browser data is copied to a temporary directory only when a
    database is locked by a running browser; the copy is deleted afterwards.
  - No network access. The tool makes no outbound requests and contains no
    analytics, telemetry or update checks.
  - No bundled third-party code. The optional Node.js backend requires the
    'classic-level' package to be installed separately at runtime; it is not
    distributed with this project.

  - 只读：绝不写入、修改或删除任何浏览器文件。仅在数据库被运行中的浏览器
    锁定时才会复制一份到临时目录，用完即删。
  - 无网络访问：不含任何对外请求、遥测或更新检查。
  - 不含第三方代码：可选的 Node 后端需自行安装 classic-level，本项目不分发它。

Responsibility
  Only process browsers and data that belong to you. Analysing someone
  else's browser data may be unlawful in your jurisdiction and can expose
  their accounts and personal information.

  请仅处理属于你自己的浏览器与数据。分析他人的浏览器数据在许多地区可能
  违法，且会暴露其账号与个人信息。

Official game data
  This project contains no game assets. Games and their assets remain the
  property of their respective rights holders.
  本项目不含任何游戏素材，游戏及其素材的版权归各自权利人所有。